title: "Epistemic Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-aware state-machine research execution toolkit with explicit
  runtime policies, bounded heuristic score propagation, digest-bound
  checkpoints, project traces, W3C PROV-aligned lineage, and a versioned
  cross-tool evidence envelope.
